<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Terms & conditions — PanFrikandel</title>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav">
  <%- include('partials/logo') %>
  <%- include('partials/lang') %>
</header>
<div class="page">
  <h1>Terms & conditions</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:700">This is a courtesy translation. In case of doubt, the <a href="/regulamin?lang=pl">Polish version</a> prevails.</p>

  <h2>§1 General</h2>
  <p>The online shop panfrikandel.pl is operated by <strong><%= company.name %></strong> (trading as PanFrikandel)<% if (company.address) { %>, <%= company.address %><% } %><% if (company.nip) { %>, tax ID (NIP): <%= company.nip %><% } %><% if (company.regon) { %>, REGON: <%= company.regon %><% } %> — a sole trader registered in the Polish Central Register of Business Activity (CEIDG). Contact: <%= company.email %><% if (company.phone) { %>, tel. <%= company.phone %><% } %>.</p>

  <h2>§2 Products</h2>
  <p>The shop sells frozen food products. Products are delivered deep-frozen and must be placed in a freezer (-18°C) immediately upon receipt. Best-before dates are printed on the packaging.</p>

  <h2>§3 Orders and payment</h2>
  <p>Orders are placed through the website. Payments are processed by Stripe (BLIK, Przelewy24, payment cards). The sales contract is concluded when the payment is confirmed.</p>

  <h2>§4 Delivery</h2>
  <p>Delivery is carried out by the Seller using its own transport, within Płock and a radius of approx. <%= delivery.radiusKm %> km around Płock; eligibility is determined by the postcode checked in the shop before ordering. Orders outside this area are currently not fulfilled.</p>
  <p>The delivery time is agreed by phone or e-mail, usually the next working day. Products are transported frozen in insulated packaging and handed over to the Customer in person. The delivery cost and the free-delivery threshold are shown at checkout.</p>

  <h2>§5 Right of withdrawal</h2>
  <p>Pursuant to Article 38(4) of the Polish Consumer Rights Act, the right of withdrawal does not apply to goods liable to deteriorate rapidly (frozen products). This does not affect your statutory rights regarding defective goods or goods not in conformity with the contract.</p>

  <h2>§6 Complaints</h2>
  <p>If products are delivered damaged or thawed, please report it on handover or within 24 h of delivery, with photos, at hallo@panfrikandel.pl. We handle complaints within 14 days.</p>

  <h2>§7 Final provisions</h2>
  <p>Matters not covered here are governed by Polish law, in particular the Civil Code and the Consumer Rights Act.</p>

  <p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">← Back to the shop</a></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
